MicroDuck model provenance
==========================

The robot geometry, kinematic dimensions, inertial parameters and mesh assets are
derived from:

  Pollen Robotics / microduck_rl
  https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl

The exact source revision is recorded in the generated Xacro header and project
artifact inventory. At the pinned October 2026 revision, LICENSE-MODELS.md
explicitly licenses STL meshes under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and MJCF XML, export
configuration and .part metadata under Apache-2.0:

  https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl/blob/ceca01706143d729305baa94cbd8ab990979e325/LICENSE-MODELS.md
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The STL files here are copied without geometry changes. SHA256SUMS records their
identity. The generated Xacro converts the source XML into ROS description form;
it references, rather than relicenses, the separately licensed STL geometry.

The ROS packaging, generator, launch files and validation scripts are separate
Apache-2.0 contributions. Upstream mesh terms continue to apply to the meshes.
